 گزرے", "bn": "তারা অতিক্রম করল", "fa": "گذشتند"}}, {"text": "بِهِمْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "يَتَغَامَزُونَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "12:105", "tense": "present", "category": {"tense": "present", "pronoun": "hum", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/1701.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "How many a portent is there in the heavens and the earth which they pass by with face averted!", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Bununla beraber göklerde ve yerde ne kadar âyet var ki, onunla yüz yüze gelirler de yine de yüz çevirip geçerler.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "اور کتنی نشانیاں ہیں آسمانوں اور زمین میں کہ اکثر لوگ ان پر گزرتے ہیں اور ان سے بے خبر رہتے ہیں،", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Dan banyak sekali tanda-tanda (kekuasaan Allah) di langit dan di bumi yang mereka melaluinya, sedang mereka berpaling dari padanya.", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "وَكَأَيِّن", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "مِّنْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ءَايَةٍ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "فِى", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلسَّمَٰوَٰتِ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَٱلْأَرْضِ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "يَمُرُّونَ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/a1e6d14eb6f41cf3368e.m4a", "gloss": {"en": "they pass", "bs": "prolaze", "tr": "geçerler", "fr": "ils passent", "id": "mereka lewat", "ur": "وہ گزرتے ہیں", "bn": "তারা অতিক্রম করে", "fa": "می‌گذرند"}}, {"text": "عَلَيْهَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَهُمْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "عَنْهَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "مُعْرِضُونَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "37:137", "tense": "present", "category": {"tense": "present", "pronoun": "antum", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/3925.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "And lo! ye verily pass by (the ruin of) them in the morning", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Ve siz elbette sabahleyin ve geceleyin onlara uğrar ve üzerlerinden geçersiniz. Hâlâ akıl edip düşünmez misiniz?", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "او ربیشک تم ان پر گزرتے ہو صبح کو،", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Dan sesungguhnya kamu (hai penduduk Mekah) benar-benar akan melalui (bekas-bekas) mereka di waktu pagi,", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "وَإِنَّكُمْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "لَتَمُرُّونَ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/0347caa72f8fe893cd07.m4a", "gloss": {"bs": "zaista prolazite", "en": "you surely pass", "tr": "mutlaka geçersiniz", "fr": "vous passez certes", "id": "kamu pasti akan melewati", "ur": "تم ضرور گزرتے ہو", "bn": "তোমরা অবশ্যই অতিক্রম করো", "fa": "قطعاً می‌گذرید"}}, {"text": "عَلَيْهِم", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "مُّصْبِحِينَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}], "forms": [{"arabic": "مَرَّ", "count": 3, "first": "2:259", "audio": "audio/2402e6463dd026e7b18c.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "past", "pronoun": "huwa", "passive": false, "objects": []}], "gloss": {"en": "he/it passed", "bs": "prošao je", "tr": "geçti", "fr": "il a passé", "id": "dia telah lewat", "ur": "وہ گزرا", "bn": "সে অতিক্রম করল", "fa": "گذشت"}}, {"arabic": "مَرُّوا۟", "count": 3, "first": "25:72", "audio": "audio/dae05412ed817f114ef2.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "past", "pronoun": "hum", "passive": false, "objects": []}], "gloss": {"bs": "su prolazili", "en": "they passed", "tr": "geçiyorlardı", "fr": "ils passèrent", "id